Package: libgeoclue-2-0
Version: @DEB_GEOCLUE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/geoclue/geoclue
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libjson-glib-1.0-0
Description: Geoinformation client library (libgeoclue)
 The libgeoclue client library for rootless iOS. gnome-shell imports gi://Geoclue
 (2.0) via misc/weather.js at boot, so this library and its on-device Geoclue-2.0
 typelib are required for the shell to start. The geoclue daemon is not built, so
 location is inert, but the typelib must exist for the static import.
